{"title":"Hrimgar","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Hrimgar is a named <a href=\"#/monster/frost-giant-chieftain\">Frost Giant Chieftain</a> seen at level 25.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Hrimgar</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Hrimfast</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 3×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-321\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"hrimgar\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>What it can drop</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/42f74c164b26deff4eb1.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/hrimgars-maul-warmace\"><b>Hrimgar&#39;s Maul</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Gold Warmace)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">Below 30% hitpoints, your attacks come 15% faster.</span></li>\n      <li><b>Gear every kill:</b> a piece from its tier, excellent or better, and a second piece 1 kill in 5.</li>\n      <li><b>Gold</b> worth about 5 ordinary kills.</li>\n      <li><b>Enchanted:</b> 1 kill in 100 enchants a piece (up to 9c, and only what its material can hold).</li>\n      <li><b>Elite:</b> a boss spawns elite 1 time in 100, and an elite makes its unique 5 times as likely.</li></ul>\n      <p class=\"muted\">From the game’s rules and its own guide. See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a>.</p>\n      <h2>Drops players have recorded</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ice-iron-torc\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/2db7f546a0b420acd8ce.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ice Iron Torc</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-medium\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/df992b2657b50a24d683.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"plume-torso\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/5b91a6e4f4b629fa7a82.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Plume Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-arms\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/1f32ba4ba4496e9683bd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/7a1ebb548706578d6b09.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Hrimgar</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/frost-giant-chieftain\">Frost Giant Chieftain</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>25</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>267</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}